;                 +|Tamarack Larch))/(|White Spruce+|Black Spruce+|Balsam Fir+|White Pine+|Tamarack Larch)] *
;                 * [1+(|Total-(|Softwood+|Hardwood))/(|Softwood+|Hardwood)]rag@80
;        >Tamarack Larch: 
;            +Method Used: Calculation
;            +Component(s)/Formula Used: 
;                -Tamarack Larch * [1+(|Softwood-(|White Spruce+|Black Spruce+|Balsam Fir+|White Pine+
;                 +|Tamarack Larch))/(|White Spruce+|Black Spruce+|Balsam Fir+|White Pine+|Tamarack Larch)] *
;                 * [1+(|Total-(|Softwood+|Hardwood))/(|Softwood+|Hardwood)]rag@80
;        >Red Maple: 
;            +Method Used: Calculation
;            +Component(s)/Formula Used: 
;                -Red Maple * [1+(|Hardwood-(|Red Maple+|White Birch+|Yellow Birch))/(|Red Maple+
;                 +|White Birch+|Yellow Birch)] * [1+(|Total-(|Softwood+|Hardwood))/(|Softwood+
;                 +|Hardwood)]rag@80
;        >White Birch: 
;            +Method Used: Calculation
;            +Component(s)/Formula Used: 
;                -White Birch * [1+(|Hardwood-(|Red Maple+|White Birch+|Yellow Birch))/(|Red Maple+
;                 +|White Birch+|Yellow Birch)] * [1+(|Total-(|Softwood+|Hardwood))/(|Softwood+
;                 +|Hardwood)]rag@80
;        >Yellow Birch: 
;            +Method Used: Calculation
;            +Component(s)/Formula Used: 
;                -Yellow Birch * [1+(|Hardwood-(|Red Maple+|White Birch+|Yellow Birch))/(|Red Maple+
;                 +|White Birch+|Yellow Birch)] * [1+(|Total-(|Softwood+|Hardwood))/(|Softwood+
;                 +|Hardwood)]rag@80
